5203: # The endpoint groups of a set of roster members ({ Entry; Identity } - Select-PanelMembers'
5204: # records): one group per provider label, merged with every other label whose members resolve
5205: # to the same provider fingerprint, to a fixed point (two labels on one base URL; every agy
5206: # label - they share one Google sign-in). A member whose identity is unresolved adds no
5207: # fingerprint. Groups are numbered in the order their first member appears. { Labels
5208: # (string[], first-seen order); Groups (object[] of { Labels (List[string]); Positions
5209: # (List[int] roster positions) }); GroupOf (hashtable roster position -> group index);
5210: # IndexOfLabel (hashtable label -> group index) }. Used twice (wave 24, D16): over a panel's
5211: # RUNNERS for the scheduling plan (Get-PanelPlan) and over ALL roster entries for the
5212: # availability view (Get-RosterAvailability: an outage marks its whole group).
