5262: # The concurrency plan of a panel (0.4.x wave 21, D8 - endpoint-aware): members that reach the
5263: # same ENDPOINT run one after another, members of different endpoints at once. The endpoint
5264: # groups come from Get-EndpointGroups over the runners. A group runs 1 member at a time unless
5265: # the roster's top-level "parallel" raises its label (a merged group: the smallest limit of its
5266: # labels); -Cap (-PanelConcurrency) caps the total (0 = no cap, 1 = strictly one after another
5267: # in roster order). $Runners: the members Select-PanelMembers runs (State 'run'), in roster
5268: # order.
